    "instruction": "Implement dark mode using prefers-color-scheme with CSS custom properties for colors.",
    "output": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --bg: #ffffff;\n    --text: #0f172a;\n    --muted: #64748b;\n    --card: #f8fafc;\n  }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    :root {\n      --bg: #0f172a;\n      --text: #e2e8f0;\n      --muted: #94a3b8;\n      --card: #1e293b;\n    }\n  }\n  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; }\n  .card { background: var(--card); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin: 2rem; }\n  .muted { color: var(--muted); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <h2>Theme-aware card</h2>\n  <p class=\"muted\">Colors follow the OS preference automatically.</p>\n</div>"
