    "instruction": "Define a full color palette with CSS custom properties for primary, accent, surface, and text tones in light and dark themes.",
    "output": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --primary: #2563eb;\n    --primary-hover: #1d4ed8;\n    --accent: #f59e0b;\n    --surface: #ffffff;\n    --surface-2: #f8fafc;\n    --text: #0f172a;\n    --text-muted: #64748b;\n    --border: #e2e8f0;\n  }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    :root {\n      --primary: #60a5fa;\n      --primary-hover: #93c5fd;\n      --accent: #fbbf24;\n      --surface: #0f172a;\n      --surface-2: #1e293b;\n      --text: #f1f5f9;\n      --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n      --border: #334155;\n    }\n  }\n  body { background: var(--surface); color: var(--text); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }\n  .btn { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; padding: .6rem 1.2rem; border: none; border-radius: 8px; }\n  .btn:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); }\n  .card { background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <h3>Themed components</h3>\n  <p>Palette adapts automatically.</p>\n  <button class=\"btn\">Primary button</button>\n</div>"
